title: "Genomic and Molecular Analysis of a 17p13.3 Microdeletion and Its Candidate Visual-Neurological Mechanisms"
type: report
authors:
  - family-names: "Laing"
    given-names: "Zachariah P."
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-8765-4601"
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-30"
license: "CC-BY-SA-3.0"
abstract: >-
  Six-phase first-pass genomic, molecular, expression, perturbational, and mechanistic analysis of a heterozygous GRCh37/hg19 chr17:1,411,408-1,841,103 deletion. The frozen interpretation supports a biologically consequential distributed visual-neural functional-reserve model while direct causation of epileptic photosensitivity by the exact CNV remains unresolved.
keywords:
  - genomics
  - copy-number variant
  - 17p13.3
  - microdeletion
  - retina
  - neuroscience
  - photosensitivity
  - epilepsy
  - bioinformatics
